{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09972","headline":"拟古 · 薛奇童","name":"拟古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沙尘朝蔽日，失道还相遇。\n寒影波上云，秋声月前树。\n川气生晓夕，野阴乍烟雾。\n沈沈滮池水，人马不敢渡。\n吮痈世所薄，挟纩恩难顾。\n不见古时人，中宵泪横注。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛奇童","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}